Process shipping amount and payment fee correctly in wallee refund (IPET-1184, IPET-1206, IPET-1269), updated for wallee/magento-2 3.5.2.
LineItemReductionService::convertShipping() subtracts the shipping discount tax compensation before comparing with the order shipping amount, otherwise a full shipping refund is never recognised.
Webhook SuccessfulCommand does not pass a partial shipping refund (unit price reduction, recognised by the remaining quantity and amount of the shipping line in the reduced line items) as creditmemo shipping amount, adds the full shipping discount only when a shipping amount is refunded and tops up the positive adjustment when the refund amount from wallee is 0.01 below the open order total.

